UNDERSTANDING OF PROCESS
================================================================================

I understand that:

1. This Central Registry Check is a requirement for employment in positions 
   involving direct care or supervision of vulnerable individuals.

2. The check will screen against state and federal registries of substantiated 
   abuse, neglect, and exploitation.

3. Any match with registry information may result in disqualification for 
   employment or specific duties.

4. I have the right to view and dispute any findings.

5. The process takes approximately 5-10 business days.

6. Results will be confidential and used for employment purposes only.

